    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "de Courcy Estate Agents de Courcy Estate Agents are delighted to offer for sale this 3-bed detached bungalow in a quiet rural location  3.7 kms to Kildimo village and 6.1 kms to Adare, 8 km to Clarina village  and just 16 kms to Limerick city centre. Accommodation comprises living room, kitchen/dining room, 3 bedrooms (1 ensuite), main bathroom and utility room.  \r\n\r\nContact: Richard de Courcy 087 2535740\r\n\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION: \r\n\r\nEntrance hall:   timber floor\r\n\r\nLiving room: 16.9 ft. x 13.1 ft. – Fireplace. Timber floor.   \r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room :  19.4 ft. x 11.2 ft. \r\nKitchen fitted 2005 and comprises sink unit with presses, drawers and eye level presses.  \r\nSliding aluminium door to rear.  \r\nTiled floor. \r\nIncluding oven, 4 ring hob, extractor and fridge freezer.  \r\n\r\nUtility room, hot-press and sink unit with presses \r\n\r\nPull downstairs to attic\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master bedroom): 14 ft. x 11 ft.  \r\nTimber floor.  Open wardrobe.  \r\nShower & toilet ensuite. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 9.3 ft. x 9.5 ft.  Timber floor \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 9.5  ft. x 7.4 ft. \r\n\r\nBathroom/WC: Bath, toilet and wash-hand-basin.\r\n\r\n\r\nWINDOWS:        PVC double-glazed windows -(installed 2005). \r\n\r\n\r\nHEATING:         Oil heating.\r\n\r\n\r\nAGE:                 1980    \r\n\r\n\r\nFLOOR AREA:  1,087 sq. ft.  (101 sq. m.)\r\n\r\n\r\nINSULATION:  External walls insulated   \r\n\r\n\t\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:  \r\nSite c. ½ acre.  \r\nSeptic tank on site.  \r\nMains water.\r\n\r\n\r\nINCLUDED:   \r\nOven, 4 ring hob, extractor and fridge freezer\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVIEWING:  By appointment with Estate Agents\r\nThese particulars are issued by de Courcy Estate Agents on the understanding that any \r\nnegotiations relating to the property are conducted through them. While every care \r\nis taken in preparing them, de Courcy Estate Agents, for themselves and for the \r\nvendor/lessor whose agents they are, give notice that: (1) The particulars are\r\n set out as general outline for guiding potential but must satisfy themselves \r\n(at their own expense) as their correctness. (3) Neither de Courcy Estate Agents\r\n or any of its employees have any authority to make any or give any \r\nrepresentation or warranty in relation to the property."
      },
